  "term": "home health aide",
  "definition": "A home health aide is a trained worker who provides personal care and related help to ill, disabled, or older people in their homes or similar living settings. This role can include daily living support, household help, communication, and working with other caregivers to support the person’s physical, mental, and social well-being.",
